purpose:
The report provides Members with details of
the Council’s Revenue Estimates (The Council’s Budget
)for 2026/27.

A decision on the approval to award a contract
for the supply of asphalt to A5209 Hall Lane + Sparrow Hill Crow,
Orchard Road, WN6 9SS.

Determination of an application to record a
public bridleway from Wennington Road to Old Moor Road, Wennington,
in the Parish of Tatham.
